<title>MEXICO: La Moderna Q1 1997 earnings table.</title>
<headline>La Moderna Q1 1997 earnings table.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  427.27 million	     575.55 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 2.971 bln		3.206 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     1.093 bln		1.248 bln</p>
<p>     Oper income	225.61 million	     392.26 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   23.12 million		203.92 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    172.06 million	     227.70 million</p>
<p>	    FX loss     20.66 million	gain  81.61 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned  38.21 million		69.97 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    177.63 million     gain  280.05 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Empresas La Moderna SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
</text>
